  "title": "Orion CSM Load onto Guppy",
  "description": "The Orion Crew and Service Module (CSM) for the Artemis I mission is rolled out from the Operations and Checkout Facility high bay to the Space Florida Operated Launch and Landing Facility. The CSM will be loaded onto NASA's Super Guppy and transported to NASA's Plumbrook Station in Sandusky, Ohio where it will undergo full environmental testing to certify the system for launch.",
